+    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: October 19, 2026</p>
+
+    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
+    <p>This website does not use cookies, analytics, advertising trackers, or fingerprinting, and does not store
+      anything in your browser. Our server does not log IP addresses or user agents.</p>
+
+    <h2>Third parties</h2>
+    <p>All images, styles, and scripts are served from our own domain. Your browser makes no requests to third-party
+      services when you view our pages, and a Content Security Policy enforces this. We re-audit any proposed
+      third-party service before adding it (see <code>PRIVACY.md</code> in the source repository).</p>
+
+    <h2>Data we collect when you create an account or order</h2>
+    <p>We will collect only what is needed to fulfill the purpose: for orders, your name and pickup details; for
+      rewards, an email address. We do not sell your data. We delete order data after it is no longer needed and
+      account data when you close your account.</p>
+
+    <h2>Your rights</h2>
+    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data at any time at
+      <a href="mailto:privacy@dailygrind.example">privacy@dailygrind.example</a>.</p>
